  unitName: Evie, Twilight Heir
  unitId: 860798
  unitNumber: 8598
  description: "Only daughter to Gortius and Miriam, Evgenia (or Evie, when times
    were simpler and happier) is the latest descendent of House Valen, the royal
    family that has held the Elysian throne for generations.An obedient and magically
    adept young woman, Evie spent her earliest years in the cold steppes of Eiros,
    until the truth of her lineage was revealed. Almost overnight, Elysia's crown
    prince\u2014long believed lost beneath the Northern Seas\u2014had suddenly returned
    with a wife and an heir. After a tumultuous battle against the corrupt Council,
    Gortius managed to reclaim the throne. Evie viewed all of this with a sense of
    wonder and delight\u2014few things were more exciting to a seven year old than
    gaining a magically adept aunt in Estia.Soon after, Gortius' health mysteriously
    began to fail, and Miriam was seized by a dark aspiration. Many dissenters in
    the court whispered it was the curse of King Radmuhl, while others blamed his
    \"\"Alethi spy\"\" of a wife. As soon as Evie reached adolescence, Miriam personally
    trained her rigorously in sword and sorcery. The colors and joys of youth all
    but bled out from Evie's life, replaced only by a bitter darkness threaded through
    with an ever-present thirst for her mother's recognition.Internal strife\u2014largely
    the work of purists who believed the country should be ruled by a pure-blooded
    Elysian\u2014had been simmering for a decade, and it reached a boiling point
    when wild rumors of the throne going to the king's \"\"tainted\"\" daughter began
    to spread. With a storm of darkness fast descending upon Elysia, the young princess
    must now choose: follow her heart and save her father's legacy, or submit to
    her mother's will..."
  summonDesc: I won't wait any longer.<br>Now is the time.<br>My mother must know
    what she has become!
  fusionDesc: Splendid. But we still have a long way to go.
  evoDesc: Mother, I hope you see in me<br>what you used to be.<br>Father would have
    wanted it...
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
